        "start_time": 52.1,
        "end_time": 57.0,
        "speaker_id": "Speaker_1",
        "speaker_role": "patient",
        "text": "D\u1ea1 kh\u00f4ng c\u00f3 co gi\u1eadt, kh\u00f4ng ng\u1ea5t v\u00e0 c\u0169ng kh\u00f4ng ph\u1ea3i \u0111au d\u1eef d\u1ed9i nh\u1ea5t.",
